          'items': list([
            '✅ Fix frontend test timeout with Starlette Git. PR #16408 by @YuriiMotov.',
            '🔧 Update sponsors: remove Permit.io. PR #16406 by @tiangolo.',
            '⬆ Bump anyio from 4.12.1 to 4.14.2. PR #16375 by @dependabot[bot].',
            '⬆ Bump the python-packages group across 1 directory with 15 updates. PR #16285 by @dependabot[bot].',
            '⬆ Bump starlette from 1.3.1 to 1.6.0. PR #16289 by @dependabot[bot].',
            '⬆ Bump annotated-doc from 0.0.4 to 0.0.5. PR #16288 by @dependabot[bot].',
            '⬆ Bump typing-inspection from 0.4.2 to 0.4.4. PR #16286 by @dependabot[bot].',
            '⬆ Bump fastar from 0.11.0 to 0.12.0. PR #16287 by @dependabot[bot].',
            '⬆ Bump the github-actions group with 5 updates. PR #16284 by @dependabot[bot].',
            '⬆ Bump pre-commit hooks. PR #16290 by @pr-submit[bot].',
            '👥 Update FastAPI GitHub topic repositories. PR #16291 by @pr-submit[bot].',
            '👥 Update FastAPI People - Sponsors. PR #16282 by @pr-submit[bot].',
            '⬆️ Bump Typer min version to 0.26.1. PR #16252 by @YuriiMotov.',
            '⬆️ Bump setup-uv action to 10.0.1. PR #16249 by @YuriiMotov.',
            '👷 Update translation PR branches with PR Push. PR #16224 by @tiangolo.',
            '⏪️ Restore commit_in_place input in translate.yml. PR #16216 by @YuriiMotov.',
            '👷 Migrate automatic labels to Latest Changes. PR #16185 by @tiangolo.',
