        'order': 35,
        'page': None,
        'text': "✅ Fix frontend test timeout with Starlette Git. PR #16408 by @YuriiMotov. 🔧 Update sponsors: remove Permit.io. PR #16406 by @tiangolo. ⬆ Bump anyio from 4.12.1 to 4.14.2. PR #16375 by @dependabot[bot]. ⬆ Bump the python-packages group across 1 directory with 15 updates. PR #16285 by @dependabot[bot]. ⬆ Bump starlette from 1.3.1 to 1.6.0. PR #16289 by @dependabot[bot]. ⬆ Bump annotated-doc from 0.0.4 to 0.0.5. PR #16288 by @dependabot[bot]. ⬆ Bump typing-inspection from 0.4.2 to 0.4.4. PR #16286 by @dependabot[bot]. ⬆ Bump fastar from 0.11.0 to 0.12.0. PR #16287 by @dependabot[bot]. ⬆ Bump the github-actions group with 5 updates. PR #16284 by @dependabot[bot]. ⬆ Bump pre-commit hooks. PR #16290 by @pr-submit[bot]. 👥 Update FastAPI GitHub topic repositories. PR #16291 by @pr-submit[bot]. 👥 Update FastAPI People - Sponsors. PR #16282 by @pr-submit[bot]. ⬆️ Bump Typer min version to 0.26.1. PR #16252 by @YuriiMotov. ⬆️ Bump setup-uv action to 10.0.1. PR #16249 by @YuriiMotov. 👷 Update translation PR branches with PR Push. PR #16224 by @tiangolo. ⏪️ Restore commit_in_place input in translate.yml. PR #16216 by @YuriiMotov. 👷 Migrate automatic labels to Latest Changes. PR #16185 by @tiangolo. 👷 Fix branch name in zizmor.yml workflow (main -> master). PR #16178 by @YuriiMotov. 👷 Remove legacy label check. PR #16180 by @tiangolo. ⬆ Bump pymdown-extensions from 11.0 to 11.0.1. PR #16162 by @dependabot[bot]. ⬆ Bump gitpython from 3.1.57 to 3.1.58. PR #16157 by @dependabot[bot]. 👥 Update FastAPI People - Sponsors. PR #16175 by @pr-submit[bot]. 🐛 Fix Sponsors Git authentication. PR #16174 by @tiangolo. 👥 Update FastAPI GitHub topic repositories. PR #16173 by @pr-submit[bot]. 🔐 Use PR Submit for automated updates. PR #16172 by @tiangolo. 🔐 Use PR Submit for translations. PR #16168 by @tiangolo. ⬆️ Raise pytest-xdist minimum. PR #16170 by @tiangolo. 🔐 Use PR Submit for pull requests. PR #16167 by @tiangolo. 👷 Use GitHub CLI for Git authentication. PR #16166 by @tiangolo. 👷 Use PR Push commit identity. PR #16164 by @tiangolo. 🔒 Replace pre-commit PAT with PR Push. PR #16161 by @tiangolo. 👷 Disable saving Zensical's .cache in build-docs.yml. PR #16156 by @YuriiMotov. 🔥 Remove the old Latest Changes workflow. PR #16148 by @tiangolo. ⬆ Bump the python-packages group with 12 updates. PR #16121 by @dependabot[bot]. ⬆ Bump cryptography from 48.0.1 to 50.0.0. PR #16142 by @dependabot[bot]. ⬆ Bump gitpython from 3.1.54 to 3.1.57. PR #16141 by @dependabot[bot]. ⬆ Bump the github-actions group with 6 updates. PR #16120 by @dependabot[bot]. 👥 Update FastAPI GitHub topic repositories. PR #16122 by @tiangolo. 👥 Update FastAPI People - Sponsors. PR #16119 by @tiangolo.",
