        'level': None,
        'links': list([
        ]),
        'order': 167,
        'page': None,
        'text': 'APIRouter has two new methods, .matches() and .handle(), counterpart to the existing ones in APIRoute. With this a router could customize how it matches and handles requests. For example, it could match only requests that include some specific header, for example for handling versions in headers.',
        'type': 'paragraph',
      }),
