        'order': 593,
        'page': None,
        'text': '📝 Add documentation for Behind a Proxy - Proxy Forwarded Headers, using --forwarded-allow-ips="*". PR #14028 by @tiangolo. 📝 Add deprecation info block about dict() in docs/tutorial/body.md. PR #13906 by @jomkv. 📝 Fix Twitter to be X (Twitter) everywhere in documentation. PR #13809 by @valentinDruzhinin. 🐛 Prevent scroll-to-top on restart/fast buttons in termynal.js. PR #13714 by @Ashish-Pandey62. 📝 Update testing events documentation. PR #13259 by @z0z0r4. 📝 Remove obsolete url field in error responses in docs. PR #13655 by @Taoup. 📝 Bring the scope claim in line with the standard in docs_src/security/tutorial005.py. PR #11189 by @DurandA. 📝 Update TrustedHostMiddleware Documentation. PR #11441 by @soulee-dev. 📝 Remove links to site callbackhell.com that doesn\'t exist anymore. PR #14006 by @dennybiasiolli. 📝 Add permalinks to headers in English docs. PR #13993 by @YuriiMotov. 📝 Update docs/en/docs/advanced/generate-clients.md. PR #13793 by @mrlubos. 📝 Add discussion template for new language translation requests. PR #13535 by @alejsdev.',
