        'order': 1434,
        'page': None,
        'text': "👥 Update FastAPI People. PR #4752 by @github-actions[bot]. ➖ Temporarily remove typer-cli from dependencies and upgrade Black to unblock Pydantic CI. PR #4754 by @tiangolo. 🔧 Add configuration to notify Dutch translations. PR #4702 by @tiangolo. 👥 Update FastAPI People. PR #4699 by @github-actions[bot]. 🐛 Fix FastAPI People generation to include missing file in commit. PR #4695 by @tiangolo. 🔧 Update Classiq sponsor links. PR #4688 by @tiangolo. 🔧 Add Classiq sponsor. PR #4671 by @tiangolo. 📝 Add Jina's QA Bot to the docs to help people that want to ask quick questions. PR #4655 by @tiangolo based on original PR #4626 by @hanxiao.",
