        'text': 'First to FastAPI 0.68.2, with no breaking changes, but upgrading all the sub-dependencies. Next to FastAPI 0.69.0, which upgrades Starlette to 0.15.0, with AnyIO support, and a higher chance of having breaking changes in your code. Finally to FastAPI 0.70.0, just upgrading Starlette to the latest version 0.16.0 with additional bug fixes.',
