        'text': '🐛 Fix docs overrides directory for translations. PR #2541 by @tiangolo. ➖ Remove Typer as a docs building dependency (covered by typer-cli) to fix pip resolver conflicts. PR #2539 by @tiangolo. ✨ Add newsletter: FastAPI and friends. PR #2509 by @tiangolo. ✨ Add new Gold Sponsor: InvestSuite 🎉. PR #2508 by @tiangolo. 🔧 Add issue template configs. PR #2476 by @tiangolo.',
