        'text': 'Run linters first in tests to error out faster. PR #948. Log warning about email-validator only when used. PR #946. Simplify Peewee docs with double dependency with yield. PR #947. Add article External Links: Create and Deploy FastAPI app to Heroku. PR #942 by @windson. Update description of Sanic, as it is now ASGI too. PR #932 by @raphaelauv. Fix typo in main page. PR #920 by @mMarzeta. Fix parsing of possibly invalid bodies. PR #918 by @dmontagu. Fix typo #916 by @adursun. Allow Any type for enums in OpenAPI. PR #906 by @songzhi. Add article to External Links: How to continuously deploy a FastAPI to AWS Lambda with AWS SAM. PR #901 by @iwpnd. Add note about using Body parameters without Pydantic. PR #900 by @pawamoy. Fix Pydantic field clone logic. PR #899 by @deuce2367. Fix link in middleware docs. PR #893 by @linchiwei123. Rename default API title from "Fast API" to "FastAPI" for consistency. PR #890.',
        'type': 'list',
      }),
