        'order': 1730,
        'page': None,
        'text': "Update docs to reduce gender bias. PR #645 by @ticosax. Add docs about overriding the operationId for all the path operations based on their function name. PR #642 by @SKalt. Fix validators in models generating an incorrect key order. PR #637 by @jaddison. Generate correct OpenAPI docs for responses with no content. PR #621 by @brotskydotcom. Remove $ from Bash code blocks in docs for consistency. PR #613 by @nstapelbroek. Add docs for self-serving docs' (Swagger UI) static assets, e.g. to use the docs offline, or without Internet. Initial PR #557 by @svalouch. Fix black linting after upgrade. PR #682 by @frankie567.",
        'type': 'list',
