            'text': 'OAuth2 scopes',
          }),
          dict({
            'href': 'https://github.com/tiangolo/fastapi/pull/141',
            'text': '#141',
          }),
        ]),
        'order': 1802,
        'page': None,
        'text': 'Improve/upgrade OAuth2 scopes support with SecurityScopes: SecurityScopes can be declared as a parameter like Request, to get the scopes of all super-dependencies/dependants. Improve Security handling, merging scopes when declaring SecurityScopes. Allow using SecurityBase (like OAuth2) classes with Depends and still document them. Security now is needed only to declare scopes. Updated docs about: OAuth2 with Password (and hashing), Bearer with JWT tokens. New docs about: OAuth2 scopes. PR #141.',
        'type': 'list',
