        'order': 166,
        'page': None,
        'text': 'register_blueprint(blueprint, **options) Register a Blueprint on the application. Keyword arguments passed to this method will override the defaults set on the blueprint. Calls the blueprint’s register() method after recording the blueprint in the application’s blueprints. Changelog Changed in version 2.0.1: The name option can be used to change the (pre-dotted) name the blueprint is registered with. This allows the same blueprint to be registered multiple times with unique names for url_for. Added in version 0.7.',
        'type': 'definition_list',
