        'order': 230,
        'page': None,
        'text': 'template_context_processors: dict[ft.AppOrBlueprintKey, list[ft.TemplateContextProcessorCallable]] A data structure of functions to call to pass extra context values when rendering templates, in the format {scope: [functions]}. The scope key is the name of a blueprint the functions are active for, or None for all requests. To register a function, use the context_processor() decorator. This data structure is internal. It should not be modified directly and its format may change at any time.',
