            dict({
              'definition': 'The internal URL rule that matched the request. This can be useful to inspect which methods are allowed for the URL from a before/after handler (request.url_rule.methods) etc. Though if the request’s method was invalid for the URL rule, the valid list is available in routing_exception.valid_methods instead (an attribute of the Werkzeug exception MethodNotAllowed) because the request was never internally bound. Changelog Added in version 0.6.',
