              'definition': 'If the response is streamed (the response is not an iterable with a length information) this property is True. In this case streamed means that there is no information about the number of iterations. This is usually True if a generator is passed to the response object. This is useful for checking before applying some sort of post filtering that should not take place for streamed responses.',
