              'definition': 'The value of the Domain parameter on the session cookie. If not set, browsers will only send the cookie to the exact domain it was set from. Otherwise, they will send it to any subdomain of the given value as well. Uses the SESSION_COOKIE_DOMAIN config. Changelog Changed in version 2.3: Not set by default, does not fall back to SERVER_NAME.',
