              'definition': 'This is called at the beginning of each request, after pushing the request context, before matching the URL. This must return an object which implements a dictionary-like interface as well as the SessionMixin interface. This will return None to indicate that loading failed in some way that is not immediately an error. The request context will fall back to using make_null_session() in this case.',
              'term': 'open_session(app, request)',
            }),
          ]),
