              'definition': 'Helper object to deal with Flask applications. This is usually not necessary to interface with as it’s used internally in the dispatching to click. In future versions of Flask this object will most likely play a bigger role. Typically it’s created automatically by the FlaskGroup but you can also manually create it and pass it onwards as click object. Changed in version 3.1: Added the load_dotenv_defaults parameter and attribute.',
