        'text': "Fix support for callable discriminators with PEP 695 type aliases by @Viicos in #13604 Preserve re.Pattern instance for compiled patterns in the experimental pipeline by @soma0212 in #13611 Fix missing GC traversal on some pydantic-core struct fields by @Viicos in #13624 Fix missing GC traversal in pydantic-core for GeneralFieldsSerializer by @Viicos in #13629 Fix JSON schema discriminator mapping keys for bool discriminators by @remi-fongaufier in #13632 Fix application of other constraints in the pipeline API by @Viicos in #13659 Support bare None annotation for discriminated unions by @Viicos in #13667 Respect runtime alias validation configuration when wrap validators are present by @Viicos in #13668 Exclude computed fields with exclude_if from JSON Schema required fields by @Bishwas-py in #13563 Use config of TypeAdapter in JSON Schema generation by @Viicos in #13676 Support populate_by_name in @validate_call by @Viicos in #13691 Allow None to serialize against secret fields by @Viicos in #13699 Do not drop include/exclude if serializer wasn’t called by @Viicos in #13702 Don’t apply serialization temporal formats to validation JSON schemas by @MLuc24 in #13711 Reflect str_min_length and str_max_length config in the JSON schema by @MLuc24 in #13714 Treat a class attribute set to None as existing when assigning with extra='allow' by @Kropiunig in #13718 Use the field name in validation JSON schemas when validate_by_alias is False by @MLuc24 in #13717 Do not rely on normalization to validate decimals by @Viicos in #13742 Handle any exception when trying to compute JSON Schema default by @Viicos in #13741 Fix Mypy plugin crash with import cycle by @Viicos in #13767 Fix supported constraints for types of datetime module by @Viicos in #13768 Fix inconsistencies between constraints and core schemas allowed values by @Viicos in #13772 Allow self to be used as a parameter with @validate_call by @Viicos in #13773 Fix race conditions in freethreaded build by @Viicos in #13785",
        'type': 'list',
