        'text': "Validate falsy AliasGenerator outputs by @jiyujie2006 in #13248 Do not resolve recursive 'definitions-ref' schemas in schema cleaning by @Viicos in #13276 Fix missing max_length check on lazy iteration validation by @davidhewitt in #13278 Handle missing errors with default factories taking validated data by @Viicos in #13291 Recognise WindowsPath as a schema type by @davidhewitt in #13326 Fix application of nested operators in pipeline API by @Viicos in #13363 Fix type variable substitution in __pydantic_extra__ by @Viicos in #13391 Fix json_schema_extra dict being dropped when a callable follows it in Annotated by @Srivatsa03 in #13374 Skip RootModel.__init__() in Mypy plugin by @Viicos in #13441 Defer placeholders in Mypy plugin by @Viicos in #13442 Do not ignore timezone offset when using 'seconds'/'milliseconds' temporal_mode by @Viicos in #13436 Make model rebuilding logic thread safe by @Viicos in #13438 Fix Interval zero bounds silently dropped in pipeline API by @pctablet505 in #13452 Sync RootModel.model_dump() signature with its parent by @Viicos in #13456 Return NotImplemented from URL ordering comparisons with foreign types by @chinesepowered in #13495 Don’t error on unhashable generic arguments on generic Pydantic models by @Viicos in #13515 Fix population of SerializationInfo.exclude_computed_fields by @Viicos in #13560 Fix serialization of ValidateAs by @Viicos in #13487 Allow reuse of validators when plugins are set by @Viicos in #13535 Avoid double-wrapping polymorphism trampoline for model serializers by @davidhewitt in #13552 Add AllowInfNan type to the field metadata gathering by @mberdyshev in #13586",
        'type': 'list',
      }),
