            'href': 'https://fixtures.nina.test/docs/validation/latest/api/pydantic/base_model/#pydantic.BaseModel.model_rebuild',
            'text': 'model_rebuild()',
          }),
        ]),
        'order': 74,
        'page': None,
        'text': 'In V2, model_rebuild() replaced update_forward_refs() from V1. There are some slight differences with the new behavior. The biggest change is that when calling model_rebuild() on the outermost model, it builds a core schema used for validation of the whole model (nested models and all), so all types at all levels need to be ready before model_rebuild() is called.',
        'type': 'paragraph',
      }),
      dict({
        'block_id': 'b_97743fa76754',
        'data': dict({
