        'text': 'class dict(**kwargs) class dict(mapping, /, **kwargs) class dict(iterable, /, **kwargs) Create a new dictionary. The dict object is the dictionary class. See also Mapping types — dict, frozendict for documentation about this class. For other containers see the built-in frozendict, list, set, and tuple classes, as well as the collections module.',
        'type': 'definition_list',
