        'text': 'PurePath.with_segments(*pathsegments) Create a new path object of the same type by combining the given pathsegments. This method is called whenever a derivative path is created, such as from parent and relative_to(). Subclasses may override this method to pass information to derivative paths, for example: Added in version 3.12.',
