        'text': 'Path.samefile(other_path) Return whether this path points to the same file as other_path, which can be either a Path object, or a string. The semantics are similar to os.path.samefile() and os.path.samestat(). An OSError can be raised if either file cannot be accessed for some reason. Added in version 3.5.',
