        'text': 'is_dir(*, follow_symlinks=True) Return True if the path is a directory, or a symbolic link pointing to a directory; return False if the path is (or points to) any other kind of file, or if it doesn’t exist. If follow_symlinks is False, return True only if the path is a directory (without following symlinks); return False if the path is any other kind of file, or if it doesn’t exist.',
