  ## v2.4.1 (2023-09-26)
  
  GitHub release
  
  ### What’s Changed
  
  #### Packaging
  
  - Update pydantic-core to 2.10.1 by @davidhewitt in #7633
  
  #### Fixes
  
  - Serialize unsubstituted type vars as Any by @adriangb in #7606
